; Load a cutscene actor list
;
; Copies a list of actors to the object list at $5DC0: the first byte of the list, the number of records, goes to
; #R$8552 (the objects waiting to be spawned), the records (template address, y, x; 4 bytes each) to $5DC0. The next game
; frame (#R$A596) spawns them with #R$8905. Used by the ending (#R$887B) with the lists #R$83A8 and #R$83AD.
;
; HL Address of the list (count, then the records)
; BC Size of the list in bytes: 1 + 4 * the count
@label=LoadCutsceneList
c$8870 LD DE,$8552
 $8873 LDI
 $8875 LD DE,$5DC0
 $8878 LDIR
 $887A RET
